        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CkjQdHXvRo2ss0xEYCclEcOygUe\"><em><strong>The chart below shows the average cost of monthly contract for four different mobile (cell phones) in a European country from January to September 2002, measured in euro.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Average Monthly Mobile Contract Cost (Jan&ndash;Sep 2002)</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QNLvdK9Xuo6n1lxkzI7lndHogXf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong><a href=\"https://rebrand.ly/task-1-line-charts\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">Giới thiệu dạng Line Graphs</span></a></strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ld0RdDHONovJfhx3MHNlRyO7gQb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i Average Monthly Mobile Contract Cost (Jan&ndash;Sep 2002) y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả chi ph&iacute; trung b&igrave;nh h&agrave;ng th&aacute;ng của g&oacute;i cước di động tại một quốc gia ch&acirc;u &Acirc;u từ th&aacute;ng 1 đến th&aacute;ng 9 năm 2002.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RjYtdjBIaozl7fxNucelpVePgtg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuyet-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tuyệt đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span> trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HCIEdsKCDotCUBx2rnyll4gggGg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Average Monthly Mobile Contract Cost (Jan&ndash;Sep 2002) với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: chi ph&iacute; của g&oacute;i cước di động - 9 th&aacute;ng từ th&aacute;ng 1 - 9.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CobPdf2INor2emxzd1GlTpySgnf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Học c&aacute;ch viết Introduction</strong> cho <strong>tất cả</strong> c&aacute;c b&agrave;i dạng <strong>Line Graphs</strong> ở đ&acirc;y bạn nh&eacute; &rarr;<strong> </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/intro-line\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">C&aacute;ch viết Introduction dạng LINE</a></strong>&nbsp;</span></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; color: rgb(79, 84, 100);\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JEbsd2QXSos0HUxGNcHlF0ntgab\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FAfYds7cTo0Mc9xhbFClViTkgig\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trends: </strong>Trong khi gi&aacute; của c&aacute;c nh&agrave; mạng kh&aacute; ổn định, nh&agrave; mạng ALPHA thay đổi nhiều nhất, từ rẻ nhất th&agrave;nh đắt nhất.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U7Qydyf9loZsKPx1ak6lBaWAgjc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences: </strong>DOMO l&agrave; nh&agrave; mạng c&oacute; gi&aacute; đắt nhất trong hầu hết giai đoạn<strong> </strong></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">Theo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P06AdwVAioetUFx6MzilxCvvgvf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Yu4MdOZ1JoLYsQxGQNRlpNuOgsb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> </strong><strong>DOMO v&agrave; ALPHA</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Yu4MdOZ1JoLYsQxGQNRlpNuOgsb\">Theo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WESqdIZnXogfxCxvfdylo7Ixg3g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu th&aacute;ng 1 </strong><em>(ph&iacute; của nh&agrave; mạng DOMO l&agrave; 15 euros, </em><em><strong>gấp ba lần</strong></em><em> của ALPHA)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XX5ld9yLKoD3DXxEIEclHeQlgoe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của DOMO </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>tăng đều</strong></em><em> l&ecirc;n 18 euros v&agrave;o th&aacute;ng 3, sau đ&oacute; </em><em><strong>dao động nhỏ</strong></em><em>, v&agrave; </em><em>đạt mức</em><em> 23 euros v&agrave;o th&aacute;ng 9)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DIl1dY5L7oGOiBxu9RiliqR5ged\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của ALPHA </strong><em>(<strong>duy tr&igrave;</strong> </em><em><strong>ổn định</strong></em><em> đến th&aacute;ng 6, </em><em><strong>tăng mạnh</strong></em><em> l&ecirc;n 25 euros v&agrave;o th&aacute;ng 9, </em><em>trở th&agrave;nh</em><em> nh&agrave; mạng đắt nhất)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HKUodfK9xogC0MxTp2Wlp70ng9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QcskdIE6RoFckExwCkClFQLsglf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: </strong><strong>LEX v&agrave; SIM TX</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QcskdIE6RoFckExwCkClFQLsglf\">Theo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QcskdIE6RoFckExwCkClFQLsglf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-W0CTdJO3RoMNQTxtpbIlnHDsgpe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SwDSddNDooDQckxnL5nlnifGgIh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1)&nbsp;<strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu th&aacute;ng 1 </strong><em>(ph&iacute; của nh&agrave; mạng LEX l&agrave; 12 euros, </em><em>trong khi</em><em> của SIM TX l&agrave; 8 euros)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SlM8dVqDGo2tRzxMRZhlexPngof\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của LEX </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>tăng đều</strong></em><em> l&ecirc;n 18 euros v&agrave;o th&aacute;ng 9)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M62Ud0BZuotQWUxIBcRlmJX0gLf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của SIM TX </strong><em>(thay đổi rất &iacute;t, kết th&uacute;c ở 7 euros v&agrave;o th&aacute;ng 9)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-W0CTdJO3RoMNQTxtpbIlnHDsgpe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TN6Fd9B0PohTNjxAWltlSG3sgUg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MgpOdgFa5orVtdxiKOPliFF8gih\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G0c3dGZoNomf7CxYvAslCF1Ugaf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MgpOdgFa5orVtdxiKOPliFF8gih\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EKwedkipNoG3gwxvnoHlYQQ7gKg\">Khi muốn diễn đạt việc \"<strong>chi ph&iacute; hợp đồng h&agrave;ng th&aacute;ng</strong>\", thay v&igrave; lặp lại \"<strong>the</strong> <strong>average cost of monthly contract</strong>\" m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể d&ugrave;ng \"<strong>the monthly subscription costs</strong>\" để c&acirc;u văn của m&igrave;nh đa dạng hơn nh&eacute;.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RUqjdCRWxoEIVsxwGB0lp7Obgzb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ: </strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NxZWd82hvoXHvjx3D2ZlpE96gYd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JHiEdtKOIoAPt2xj7OplKTCKg6f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NxZWd82hvoXHvjx3D2ZlpE96gYd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DsIQdD4seopGmOxfO3wlYuJggvg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">The line graph illustrates <strong>the monthly subscription costs</strong> of four mobile phone providers in a European country over a nine-month period in 2002, measured in euros.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 491,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<p>The line graph illustrates the monthly subscription costs of four mobile phone providers in a European country over a nine-month period in 2002, measured in euros.</p>",
            "question_id": 13810,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 492,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RPRCd9R6GofNuixFdwtlWJnZgSg\">Overall, while most providers maintained relatively stable prices throughout the period, ALPHA showed the most dramatic change, rising from the lowest to the highest position. Additionally, DOMO consistently remained the most expensive option for most of the period shown.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13810,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 493,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P2YXdcrcNojAnAxmcbjlnNzBgyc\">Regarding the providers with the most significant price changes, in January, DOMO charged approximately 15 euros for its monthly subscription, which was three times higher than ALPHA's rate of about 5 euros. DOMO then showed a gradual increase to about 18 euros in March, before experiencing minor fluctuations and ending at roughly 23 euros in September. Meanwhile, ALPHA maintained relatively stable prices until June, after which it rose sharply to become the most expensive provider at about 25 euros by the end of the period.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13810,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 494,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WGDcdqs3uoRiuPxfhzHlPqWFggc\">Regarding the other two providers, LEX started at about 12 euros in January, while SIM TX began at a lower rate of approximately 8 euros. The former maintained a relatively steady upward trend to reach approximately 18 euros in September. Similarly, the latter showed minimal variations throughout the period, finishing at about 7 euros.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13810,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
